{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/842054-can-i-get-some-help-with-a-beast-concept","id":842054,"title":"Can I get some help with a beast concept...?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-04T12:09:32-08:00","id":842054,"title":"Can I get some help with a beast concept...?","content":"Trying to work something out here... I'm trying to put together a beast that is like.. an alien from the depths of space. While the lair is easy enough to hash out.. I'm at a loss as to what the best family would be.. I could totes see ungallu.. but I can also see makara or esmakai. Imagery would be something akin to the greys, but not quite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T13:42:21-08:00","id":842124,"title":"","content":"First thing first, I would think, is understand why and how your Horror is scary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T14:02:41-08:00","id":842138,"title":"","content":"Its the thing from between the stars.. you don't know how it thinks.. why it does the things it does, its technology and abilities outstrip anything you know so far it might as well be magic. It always appears without warning, taking people away and doing horrendous things before returning them.. you never know when it might come for you, to take you away to that horrible place... all you know is that you are powerless to stop it when it comes.<br /> <br /> <br /> The more I say.. the more I think ungallu...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T14:15:45-08:00","id":842147,"title":"","content":"To be honest, it sounds like you're describing an Anakim.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T16:35:21-08:00","id":842232,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking it is feasible to be potentially both. They come from above after all.. I guess having that knowledge could be seen as an aspect of mimir's wisdom..<br /> <br /> I don't see the inherent power (Destroying barriers) as really something the grey would be known for... but most people are rendered helpless and exposed in their recounts of the visits by the greys. which is more an ugallu thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-04T23:10:49-08:00","id":842423,"title":"","content":"Well it depends on how you look at it. Ugallu are the nightmares of exposure and the idea that this thing is just waiting to drop out and take you isn't a bad one for it. The Anakim fits more with the idea that it can't be stopped. The bit you say about rendered helpless is basically Anakim 101 the idea for the Anakim is supposed to be that the best way to stop these things is not to be something its interested in. <br /> <br /> For powers well the rending barriers depends on how you look at it. Like you said the grey aren't well known for doing stuff like kicking in doors, however the stories I always heard included stuff like a bright light and the doors just bursting open like they weren't locked. Granted the Ugallu ability to analyze and find out about a person would fit into the aliens probing someone stories. Honestly though your description when you went into it was all about how this thing wasn't stoppable and it outstripped everything a person could do, so I think this thing would be more of an Anakim than anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-06T13:02:02-08:00","id":843107,"title":"","content":"Yeah I can see that now.. I think its the flavor text of the powers that's throwing me. Event he in family atavisms like cyclopean strength could be described.. not as some hulking behemoth ripping up a street post.. but the tall slender alien touching it and it rips itself from the ground maybe? I Guess figuring out atavisms and reflavoring them so they fit the theme would only be marginally harder... mimir's wisdom is just fine as it is... Monster from the deep can again totally be seen as an alien's force weapon or again.. telekinetic power... Needs must and eye of heaven are really good for the concept as a whole tho.<br /> <br /> Nightmares.. well more than a few work just fine. Lair traits seem pretty easy to choose from as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-06T13:32:14-08:00","id":843121,"title":"","content":"Tactile telekinesis would work for Cyclopean Strength or Titanic Blow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-06T13:45:27-08:00","id":843126,"title":"","content":"You could give them Long of Limb from the Other Atavism Ideas? thread. Basically it just extends your reach. It's Eshmaki if memory serves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T22:51:07-07:00","id":847556,"title":"","content":"If you go Anakim for you concept I highly recommend incorporating the alien technology into your Horror's form. Like the walkers from War of the Worlds. Colossal and absolutely alien but with a brilliant intelligence hidden within (either literally or figuratively since you could make them a biomechanical Horror like a Dalek or the Borg.) Hope that gives some good for thought. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T00:36:09-07:00","id":847569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/842054-can-i-get-some-help-with-a-beast-concept?p=847556#post847556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you go Anakim for you concept I highly recommend incorporating the alien technology into your Horror's form. Like the walkers from War of the Worlds. Colossal and absolutely alien but with a brilliant intelligence hidden within (either literally or figuratively since you could make them a biomechanical Horror like a Dalek or the Borg.) Hope that gives some good for thought. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Daleks as a Horror? Can I steal this idea?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T13:50:55-07:00","id":847841,"title":"","content":"Hellz ya! XD<br /> <br /> I would imagine that if you were going for a protagonist their lesson would be something along the lines of &quot;Cherish what you have and the life you've been given, for it can be taken away in the span of seconds to one bright flash and the metallic sound of someone shouting EXTERMINATE!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":". 03-15-2016, 04:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T14:40:10-07:00","id":847870,"title":"","content":"I was thinking rather &quot;Do not underestimate ANYTHING&quot;, since most people's first reaction would probably be laughing at how hillarious their situation is, but this'll do too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T16:13:51-07:00","id":847906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inquisitor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/842054-can-i-get-some-help-with-a-beast-concept?p=847870#post847870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was thinking rather &quot;Do not underestimate ANYTHING&quot;, since most people's first reaction would probably be laughing at how hillarious their situation is, but this'll do too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it's not like lessons are set in stone. You can always alternate between the two and a third of &quot;Do not laugh at the psycho wielding an egg beater in one hand a plunger in the other.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}